keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM orchestration
  - human-AI collaboration
  - task decomposition
  - software engineering automation
abstract: >-
  SPOQ is a methodology for multi-agent software development combining
  wave-based topological dispatch, dual validation gates, and
  Human-as-an-Agent integration. Evaluation across six projects
  demonstrates 1.3-5.3x speedup over sequential execution.
